msgstr "Prvý riadok"

msgid "First column"
msgstr "Prvý stĺpec"

msgid "Both"
msgstr "Oboje"

msgid ""
"You will need to clear cache for changes to this setting to appear in "
"CKEditor."
msgstr ""
"Na prejavenie zmien tohto nastavenia v CKEditor je potrebné vymazať "
"vyrovnávaciu pamäť."

msgid "Theme compatibility"
msgstr "Kompatibilita témy"

msgid "Configuration tips"
msgstr "Tipy ku konfigurácii"

msgid ""
"If the checker <strong>toggle</strong> does not appear: make sure a z-"
"indexed or overflow-hidden element in your front-end theme is not hiding or "
"covering the <code><em>ed11y-element-panel</em></code> container, make sure "
"that any custom selectors in the \"Disable the scanner if these elements are "
"detected\" field are not present, and make sure that no JavaScript errors "
"are appearing in your <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/"
"Tools/Browser_Console\"> browser console</a>"
msgstr ""
"Ak sa <strong>prepínač</strong> nástroja nezobrazuje: uistite sa, že prvok s "
"z-indexom alebo overflow:hidden v téme frontendu neskrýva ani nezakrýva "
"kontajner <code><em>ed11y-element-panel</em></code>, a uistite sa, že žiadne "
"vlastné selektory v poli „Zakázať kontrolu, ak sú na stránke tieto prvky\" "
"nie sú prítomné, a že sa v <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/"
"docs/Tools/Browser_Console\">konzole prehliadača</a> nevyskytujú chyby "
"JavaScriptu"

msgid ""
"If the checker toggle is present but <strong>not detecting</strong> errors, "
"or missing errors that should be flagged: check that your inclusions & "
"exclusion settings below are not missing or ignoring the elements. It is not "
"uncommon for homepages or views to insert editable content outside the "
"<code><em>main</em></code> element."
msgstr ""
"Ak je prepínač nástroja prítomný, ale <strong>nezisťuje</strong> chyby alebo "
"prehliadá chyby, ktoré by mali byť označené: skontrolujte, či vaše "
"nastavenia zahrnutia a vylúčenia nižšie nechýbajú ani neprehliada prvky. Nie "
"je neobvyklé, že domovské stránky alebo zobrazenia vkladajú upraviteľný "
"obsah mimo prvku <code><em>main</em></code>."

msgid "Theme"
msgstr "Téma"

msgid "Sleek"
msgstr "Sleek"

msgid "Classic"
msgstr "Classic"

msgid "Dark"
msgstr "Dark"

